<programme channel="DocuBox.HD.fr" start="20261031184500 +0000" stop="20261031191000 +0000">
    <title lang="fr">Wow, I Never Knew That!</title>
    <sub-title lang="fr">Kitty Litter, Bullet Proof Vest, Neon Lights</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">It was the PURRRFECT idea for making our furry friends more pleasant around the house! You'll learn how KITTY LITTER clawed its way into our homes. And you'll learn how a garment made out of special woven fibers can stop a bullet, plus, why is walking under a ladder bad luck? And finally, we'll CUT TO THE CHASE and explain the history behind this common phrase!</desc>
