    <title>Sarah Brightman</title>
    <sub-title>Symphony in Vienna</sub-title>
    <desc>Sarah Brightman is an English soprano singer who has won 160 gold and platinum albums in 34 countries. Only the soundtrack to the musical The Phantom of the Opera, played by Sarah, sold more than 40 million copies.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/CA_USQT620324A_538054851_0_20240207T123443233Z_126.jpeg" />
