    <title>Jimi Hendrix</title>
    <sub-title>American Landing : Live at Monterey</sub-title>
    <desc>In June 1967, Jimi Hendrix returned to his native country and transformed the cultural, musical and fashion landscapes. Punctuated by Hendrix lighting his instrument on fire, the U.S. debut performance of the Jimi Hendrix Experience at the Monterey Pop Festival propelled the guitarist and his band mates to the top ranks of international rock royalty.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/CA_USQT620324A_2825504021_0_20260422T152158996Z_106_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-796646965d-s5xsw.jpeg" />
